## First failed attempts (for audit trail)
1. Incomplete `git clone --no-checkout` of partial-blob repo → missing `src/CMakeLists.txt` etc. Fixed via `git archive` of pin.
2. First build targeted `llama-bench llama-cli` → ninja unknown target `llama-cli`. Retry: `llama-bench` only → OK.

